mprove you aiming skills, so you can survive in Multiplayer Shooter.\n\n- Different level, each designed to train another aspect of your aiming skills.\n- Aiming in generel\n- Aiming speed by training your reflexes\n- Trigger speed\n- Improveingperipheral vision\n\nThe training sessions are not designed to be fun but they are designed to be efficient. ", "short_description": "Shooting Practise is designed to improve you aiming skills, so you can survive in Multiplayer Shooter. Even the best strategy does not help, if you are not able to aim and shoot quickly. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://logic-horizon.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://logic-horizon.com/termsconditions/", "publisher_name": "BrownBuckGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://logic-horizon.com/shooting-practise/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9280079665347344"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982689_524520214077519_3853889678739979404_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lUQO_37jPeMQ7kNvwHa04NC&_nc_oc=AdqM6dNZl5UZUSqcppuoMXRnSMT72dXKEz_ecN85XkBYyCijYXkRzqYY6NVAgMKK2Co&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc